      "differs": "csd-client does not hand the SDK a non-2xx body, so the SDK cannot tell a proxy's JSON refusal from an HTML page; it reads 400, 413 and 429 as answered before forwarding (cairn-substrate.com, nginx, Cloudflare do). Money: unsafe only behind a front that answers this status after forwarding, which SubmitVerdict documents."
